    ],
    "description": "This picture is of Nagasaki's Ground Zero.  On August 9, 1945, the atomic bomb was dropped on Nagasaki.  Three days earlier, an atomic bomb had been also been dropped on Hiroshima.  About 40,000 people died instantly.  About 60,000 were injured at the end."
  },
