    "filename": [
      "4437-chinese-dingyao-twin-fish-bowl.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "6\" w. Very thinly potted and molded stoneware with slightly cupped and flared near the rim, molded in the center of the interior with two fish swimming in a combed pattern of water with five slightly raised lines radiating out toward the rim, small and short fine foot ring, greenish-beige glaze except on the rim, foot ring and base."
  },
