    "id": "4436",
    "filename": [
      "4436-chinese-copper-red-pot.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "2 3/4\" x 2 3/4\". Globular form with white ground glazed all over except for the bottom of the foot ring, painted with copper-red dragons pursuing a pearl amid cloud forms on two sides, a band above the foot ring with floral meander and a band of alternating ruyi heads and bats around the mouth, details picked out with gilding, plus a gilded ring on the lip, marked in red enamel, within an incised ring, with four character mark of Qianlong and of the period."
  },
