    "id": "4416",
    "filename": [
      "4416-beijing-university-boya-tower.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Constructed in 1924 to supply the Yanjing University campus with water, Boya (\"erudition\") Tower has since, along with Weiming (\"unnamed\") Lake, become an iconic feature of the Beijing University campus."
  },
  {
