    "description": "The black plaque on the large white stone says \"Termites.\" In smaller letters below it says,\" .... in peace\" (probably something like \"rest in peace,\" but the verb is illegible).  The pillar to the right says the site was dedicated by a company in Japan that eliminates termites."
  },
