      "4331-old-and-new-in-okunoin.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "The stump from an old cryptomeria tree, likely six hundred years or more in age when it was felled, provides the fertile ground for the growth of a small new sapling. A striking visual metaphor for life, death and renewal?"
  },
