    "Collection": "Japanese Religion Images",
    "id": "4327",
    "filename": [
      "4327-hall-of-lights.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This newer structure, adjacent to the mausoleum, houses thousands of lamps donated by faithful in memory of their loved ones. The hall surpasses in scale, but perhaps not in grace, the mound of statues to the right dedicated to the spirits of the unremembered."
  },
  {
