      "4272-kailash-cave-temple-inner-sanctum-doorway.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This doorway leads into a small shrine room with a lingam carved in a yoni, symbol of the union of Shiva and Shakti, the divine male and female.  The light of the candle, the only illumination in this inner shrine room, is visible through the doorway."
  },
