      "4265-kailash-cave-temple-amorous-couple-2.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Auspicious figures of amorous couples in small stone niches adorn the magnificent Kailash Cave Temple, cave #16 in the series of Ellora Caves.  These figures represent fertility and good fortune for all who see them."
  },
