      "4262-ellora-hindu-caves-wedding-of-shiva-and-parvati.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Shiva takes Parvati's hand to lead her around the sacred fire to solemnize their wedding.  Attending the ceremony are dozens of celestial apsaras and gandharvas to dance and sing, as well as Brahma and Vishnu at Shiva's left.  The couple standing next to Parvati may be her parents, Himalaya and Meena."
  },
