      "4253-ellora-buddhist-caves-assembly-hall.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This cave appears to have been excavated as a gathering places for the monks.  Along the middle of the cave run two long stone benches where monks would have sat to eat, listen to teachings, chant, etc.  Like others in this series, this cave demonstrates that large numbers of monks congregated in this area."
  },
