    ],
    "description": "The Jalal al-Din Dargah overlooks this spring-fed pond which is understood to have miraculous healing properties.  In particular, people with mental illnesses drink and touch this water hoping to regain their health."
  },
  {
    "Title": "Khuldabad Jalal al-Din Dargah, tree branch, close-up",
