    ],
    "description": "Photograph taken near the Yokogawa Station in October, 1945, showing the makeshift huts in which survivors were living.^^Collection Librarian: Amy Bryant. Please send comments or content corrections to Michael Thiedeman, Professor of Art, Earlham College, Richmond, IN 47374 USA. email address: thiedmi@earlham.edu"
