  {
    "Title": "Hiroshima:  Peace Memorial Museum, Art by Survivors, 23 -- \"A father carries his transformed son on his bicycle.\"",
    "Creator": "Ishida, Akira",
    "Contributor": "Thiedeman, Michael",
    "Institution": "Earlham College",
    "Source": "",
    "Rights": "Materials may be used for educational, non-commercial purposes only, in accordance with Fair Use policies. Acknowledgement to be given to the IDEAS Project, to Earlham College, and to the Peace Memorial Museum of Hiroshima.",
    "Subject": "People; Hiroshima; victims",
