    "description": "Colored glaze tile archway at the entrance to the Reclining Buddha Temple (Wofo si) in Beijing's Western Hills district. The 7th century structure's calligraphy (\"assembling for instruction in the esoteric canon\") is the Qianlong Emperor's (r. 1736-1795)."
