    "description": "Bas-relief of the Wuchang Uprising of 10 October 1911, which led to the overthrow of the Qing dynasty. The relief is one of eight revolutionary events depicted on the base of the  Monument to the People's Heroes in tiananmen Square, completed 1958."
  },
