    ],
    "description": "Edition: 13/150. Mezzotint; ink and colors on paper.^^Artist: Born Sapporo. She studied printmaking in France between 1968 and 1970 at the Ecole de Dessin, Nice, and showed in the Pistoia International Print Exhibition, Italy. Has been active as a professional printmaker since then, showing her works in galleries throughout Japan and also in the USA. She specializes in still life pictures of fruits, flowers, and vegetables."
