      "3747-aurangzeb-mosque-and-tomb-sign.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This sign in the courtyard of the mosque complex explains that this area contains the Shrine of the saint, Zainuddin, and the tomb of the son of Aurangzeb, Azamshah.  The sign is written in English, Hindi, and Urdu."
  },
