    "filename": [
      "3743-aurangzeb-mosque-entranceway-and-view-from-outside.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "The yellow gate area marks the entrance into the mosque and tomb of the Emporor Aurangzeb.  Stalls selling various religious goods line the passage leading into mosque.  Worshippers can buy plaques inscribed with Qur'anic passages, scale models and photographs of religious shrines, scarves, prayer caps (topis), and books, among other religious goods.  The sign \"STD, ISD\" designates a long distance telephone booth."
  },
