    "description": "At the base of a buddha figure, lay devotees, men and women, carry offerings, possibly to celebrate the end of the rainy season retreat.  The hair of the laypeople is emphasized in these figures perhaps as a contrast to the shaved heads of the monks and nuns."
  },
