  {
    "Title": "Nagasaki:  American witness",
    "Creator": "Story, Louise",
    "Contributor": "Earlham College",
    "Institution": "",
    "Source": "The New York Times, June 20, 2005",
    "Rights": "Material may be used for educational, non-commercial purposes only, in accordance with Fair Use policies.  Acknowledgement to be given to The New York Times.",
