    "description": "This clock, now in the Atomic Bomb Museum in Nagasaki, stopped at the instant of the atomic bomb blast, 11:02 am, August 9, 1945.^^Editorial assistant:  Joseph Augustin.  Collection Librarian:  Amy Bryant.  Please send comments or content corrections to Michael Thiedeman, Professor of Art, Earlham College, Richmond, IN  47374  USA.  email address:  thiedmi@earlham.edu"
