      "3407-muroji-032-hall-for-memorial-tablets-viewed-from-m.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "The entrance to the Hall for Memorial Tablets, at Muroji is on ground level of a small level area.  Most of the hall, however, is built out over the steep hillside, supported on scaffolding, as shown in this image taken from the stone stairs as one approaches the small plateau.^^Editorial assistant:  Sandy Augustin.  Collection Librarian:  Amy Bryant.  Please send any questions, comments, or content corrections to Michael Thiedeman, Professor of Art, Earlham College, Richmond, IN 47374 USA.  email address:  thiedmi@earlham.edu"
