      "3384-muroji-005-koi-in-a-small-pond-near-the-nio-gate.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "On one's left as one walks along the path just inside the Nio gate at Muroji, is a small pond with lilly pads and koi .^^Editorial assistant:  Sandy Augustin.  Collection Librarian:  Amy Bryant.  Please send any questions, comments, or content corrections to Michael Thiedeman, Professor of Art, Earlham College, Richmond, IN 47374 USA.  email address:  thiedmi@earlham.edu"
