    "filename": [
      "3281-cake-from-bakery.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "It is not unusual to see many kinds of cakes of elaborate design being sold in bakeries.  Most celebrations such as birthdays or special occasions involve this kind of cake.  Many people are seen carrying boxes of these.  If one goes to Korea, be sure to buy one of these for a special occasion:  they're quite inexpensive."
  },
