    "id": "3194",
    "filename": [
      "3194-binzasara.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Pieces of wood are held together with strings.  Hands are placed at the handles, with about a shoulder width between hands.  When the hands are brought toward each other, the wooden pieces hit against each other to produce sounds.  Used in traditional folk music."
  },
