      "2870-fan-painting-calligraphy.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "88 lines in a pattern of two long and two short lines of tiny regular script. Dedication, date and signature in last two lines. No further information on this writer was found. As stated elsewhere, the ability to write in such small, almost microscopic, characters is as much a testament to the writer's eyesight, patience, and technical skill as to his artistry. Further work on the subject of the fan is in order."
