      "2530-53-stations-of-the-tokaido-hakone-station-11.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Color woodblock, 7 X 9 1/4 inches, ink and color on paper. Burning pink flames between grey mountains as porters travel along the narrow and steep mountain pass at Hakone, near Lake Ashinoko. Hiroshige captured the moment when porters struggle to carry their feudal retainers in sedan chairs as darkness nears.^^Originally purchased from Arts and Crafts, Yokoyama, Tokyo"
