    ],
    "description": "4-1/8 (L) x 3 (W) inches. Round silver G'au or reliquary box with beaded rim and scrolling leaf filigree design on the lid with a single coral bead in the middle.  The back has a removable base plate made of copper.  The cover fitted on one side with a long looped ring and a pointed bead on the other."
