      "2454-hexagonal-gau.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "4-1/8 (L) x 3-3/4 (W) inches. Hexagonal silver G'au or reliquary box with a beaded rim and scrolling leaf filigree design on the lid which is fitted with three turquoise and four red glass beads, each bound with red leather.  The back has a removable base plate made of tin stamped with English Lettering: \"Stand and Fire.\"  The cover fitted on one side with a long looped ring and a pointed bead on the other."
  },
