    "description": "7-3/4 (L) x 3-1/2 (Dia.) inches. Metal bell with a brass handle.  The brass handle is composed of a half dorje surmounting the head of a lotus crowned wisdom deity (Yum or Mother) which sits on a lotus flower.  The bronze bell has lotus petals on the dome, a band of conch shells with lotus flowers in them and a band of dorje around the rim.  The inside has four lotus petals in the dome with some characters (possibly Om ah hum)  and a long iron clapper attached to a ring with a  piece of white cloth."
  },
