      "2412-padmarupa-thangka-detail.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Ground mineral pigment on cotton, silk, 50-1/2 (L) x 30-1/2 (W). Padmarupa wears a five -skull crown and holds a conch in his left hand and a drum in his right.  Above him are Paden chogyo, Chok Lang, Marme Dzay, Chokyi Drakpa and Yonten O.  In front are Yawa Huti, and ascetic and the scholar Gaya Bhara.  In the lower foreground are Mahakala, a monk and Lhamo.  Painted in Central Tibetan style."
  },
