    "id": "2370",
    "filename": [
      "2370-wheel-thrown-dark-brown-teabowl-with-brocade-mat.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This teabowl, with its brocade mat and dark brown glaze, is said to have been one that was presented to soldiers upon their safe return in WWII. The teabowl has a right angle carved into the bottom of the foot; along the base of the bowl are Japanese characters; the mat is stripped aqua, mustard, forest green, orange, lavender and gray under a golden floral design with an animal all over."
  },
