    "id": "2208",
    "filename": [
      "2208-leather-shadow-puppet.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Tantric sorcery image for use in Wayang Kulit performance.  Images of disarticulated body parts are used as talismans in occult Balinese ritual.  This would be used in a narrative passage to indicate the casting of a spell by one of the major characters in the story."
  },
