    "Collection": "ASIANetwork-Luce Asian Art in the Undergraduate Curriculum Project",
    "id": "2210",
    "filename": [
      "2210-leather-shadow-puppet.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Hanuman, the leader of the monkey army and loyal servant of Rama.  This specific image of Hanuman would be used only once in the Wayang Kulit Ramayana performance to represent the episode in which Hanuman flies to Lanka bearing the healing herbs that will enable the distressed monkey army to rally and turn the tide in their epic struggle with the demon army."
  },
