    "id": "2030",
    "filename": [
      "2030-portrait-full-view.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "19th century portrait depicting a subject seated in a garden by a stream, chrysanthemum in a vase and a pine tree. The chrysanthemum in the vase symbolizes autumn while the pine tree represents longevity. The image area is 67cm x 130.5 cm and was made using Chinese ink and colors on paper in a silk mounting. The subject and artisitic style are reminiscent of the famous artist, Ren Xiong (1820-1864).  Ren Xiong and his family members were successful commercial painters in Shanghai and nearby regions and skilled in many subjects, including portraiture."
  },
