    ],
    "description": "The object is made of either solid silver or pewter due to its heavy weight.  Its function could be as a paperweight, an incense burner, or both.  The motifs (turtle, cranes, and pine trees) have common auspicious associations with longevity, and became favored by the samurai classes after the 16th century in Japan."
