    "filename": [
      "1861-new-grave-marker.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This new stone rests on a site that must have held a much older marker before. I believe the inscription on the sphere reads, \"Meet together in one place,\" which would refer to a belief that some Buddhists have that they will join together after death in the Pure Land of the Buddha Amida."
  },
