    "filename": [
      "1809-minatogawa-jinja-plaque-describing-historical-orig.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This plaque tells of the founding of Minatogawa Shrine. It notes that the shrine was created by order of the Meiji Emperor in 1868 in honor of Kusunoki Masanari, who died here in 1336 along with fifteen of his family members, all of whom committed suicide."
  },
