    "filename": [
      "1793-ikuta-jinja-woman-praying-before-main-shrine-hall.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "After clapping her hands, ringing the bell and bowing up closer to the hall, in the traditional manner, this young woman backed up several steps and stood with her head bowed for many minutes while facing the shrine."
  },
  {
    "Title": "Ikuta Jinja - Torii lined path",
