    "Latitude": "34.666667",
    "Longitude": "135.116667",
    "Date": "10/07/2002",
    "Coverage": "",
    "Type": "Still Image",
    "Dimensions": "640 w x 480 h, 72 ppi",
    "Collection": "Japanese Religion Images",
    "id": "1783",
    "filename": [
      "1783-ikuta-jinja-an-ema-with-a-wish.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This ema reads, \"May Bun-chan's leg [or foot] heal quickly and may he graduate without any difficulty.\" Imprinted on the ema to the left is a place for the name and address of the petitioner, which is given in full. The petitioner's name is female; presumably this is a mother praying for her son."
  },
