    ],
    "description": "Just inside the first torii gate, which here is gray concrete, is this vermillion second torii. The cars parked here are likely affiliated with the shrine. If the open areas of the shrine were available for parking they would always be full in this crowded city."
  },
  {
    "Title": "Ikuta Jinja - Main gate of Ikuta Jinja",
