      "1777-hasedera-pathway-to-sub-temple-at-hasedera.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "A pathway from the main plaza leads to this sub-temple. To the right are numerous stone statues of Jizo lining the walkway. These are commonly donated, and dressed with aprons and caps, by faithful who have lost a child (usually while in the womb) with hopes that the soul will fare well."
  },
