    "filename": [
      "1736-hasedera-bell-tower-at-top-of-stairs.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This bell tower adorns the top of the stairway. One enters this central plaza from the stairway just beneath the bell. The main hall stands just to the right (behind the palm tree).  The white spherical lanterns are visible there. From this plaza, the views of surrounding hills are superb."
  },
