    ],
    "description": "The hilly complex at Hasedera encompasses many interesting buildings, each with a unique design that features particular combinations of stone, wood, tile, and painted mud walls, as well as careful landscaping."
  },
  {
    "Title": "Hasedera - Alongside covered stairway",
