    "filename": [
      "1718-ellora-jain-caves-mahavira.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Mahavira, the 24th Jain tirthankara, is depicted in a seated position with back straight and eyes lowered under a double canopy.  Stylized lions are at his feet."
  },
  {
    "Title": "Ellora, Jain Caves, Mahavira shrine entrance",
    "Creator": "",
    "Contributor": "Benton, Cathy",
    "Institution": "Lake Forest College",
    "Source": "",
