    "Collection": "Religious Sites in Maharashtra",
    "id": "1714",
    "filename": [
      "1714-ellora-jain-caves-yaksha-elephant-detail.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Held in the trunk of the elephant is a lotus symboliizing spiritual pursuits and a gentle nature.  Placing this lotus in the trunk of this wild and powerful beast, the sculptor may be commenting on the greater power of the Jain practice of non-violence toward all creatures."
  },
  {
    "Title": "Ellora, Jain Caves, Yaksha's elephant seat",
    "Creator": "",
