    "filename": [
      "1711-ellora-jain-caves-entrance-to-the-mahavira-shrine.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "This shrine to Mahavira, the 24th tirthankara, is set within a very large cave with exquisite carvings of several of the 24 tirthankaras."
  },
  {
