    "id": "1202",
    "filename": [
      "1202-lacquer-collage.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Mixed media vertical image of Mao looking out over a sleeping child. Child is positioned on a bed of Coca Cola cans under the watchful eyes of a group of white dogs.  In the distance, the Forbidden City is seen, still bearing Mao's portrait but with a Coca Cola sun rising over it."
  },
