    "description": "Mixed media vertical image of two Coca Cola cans, wreathed in flowers and ardent Communist supporters, all placed on a Coca Cola platform.  Hands raised in support below, the figures spiraling up the cans also clasp them in their hands. A yellow and red sunburst pattern fills the background."
