    "id": "1276",
    "filename": [
      "1276-dish.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Kidney shape with scalloped rim; decorated in polychrome enamels, with a border of diapers, frets, scales, butterflies, and sprays on the rim, honeycomb-diaper band at the well, central emblem of an eagle bearing a shield and holding a laurel branch in one talon and arrows in the other, and with a banner inscribed E Pluribus Unum.^^Donor: Mr. and Mrs. Euchlin Reeves"
  },
  {
    "Title": "Dish - bottom view",
    "Creator": "",
