    "id": "1038",
    "filename": [
      "1038-stoneware-dish-front.jpg"
    ],
    "description": "Front view of one of a set of small offering plates.  The front side features an incised lotus in which the green glaze sits to highlight the design. A light crackle effect can be seen on all of the set pieces; the underside is useful for showing how the glaze flows over the body of the plate, clinging but not entirely covering it."
  },
